    	second identity Bearer token for BOLA/authz differential (optional)
  -confirm
    	authorization confirmed
  -cookie string
    	Cookie header for authenticated testing (optional)
  -cookie-b string
    	second identity Cookie header for BOLA/authz differential (optional)
  -deep
    	deep phase: nuclei + sslscan + content-discovery + screenshots (slow)
  -insecure-auth
    	skip TLS verification for credentialed requests (self-signed targets only; exposes credentials to a MITM)
  -intrusive
    	enable write/credential tests
  -intrusive-confirm
    	second confirmation for intrusive tests
  -profile string
    	aggression profile: passive | safe-active | adversarial-readonly | authorized-exploit (default "safe-active")
  -save
